    "name": "IDatabaseConnectionConfiguration",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "csharp",
    "contract": "IDatabaseConnectionConfiguration requires a mutable DatabaseKey and exposes a read/write connection pair: ReadConnectionInternal and WriteConnectionInternal are IDataConnection values available for retrieval only. A conforming implementation must permit consumers to assign DatabaseKey, retrieve both connection values, and must not expose setters for either connection value."
